          "height" : 17.5,
          "text" : "Following the continuous rail",
          "width" : 208.3,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 150.4
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "At the inlet, the team repeated the check. The reader carried the rule from",
