          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 211.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "exposed a second line that had been hidden by the lip. The clerk entered both",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 223.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "marks in the same box and drew a short bar between them. A narrow gap",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 235.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "beneath the board let the strip settle after each reading. When the gauge re-",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 247.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "turned to the shelf the lower mark remained visible. The last entry records",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 259.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "the position of the stop after the board was lifted. At the first bend the nar-",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 271.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "row foot of the rule touched the curved wall, so the team took the reading",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 283.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "from the opposite bank. This moved the observer without moving the gauge.",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 295.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "A second slip carried a sketch of the foot beside the curve. At the middle gate",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 307.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "there was no room for the full rule. The shorter rule had the same divisions",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 319.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "but started at its cut end. The clerk copied the offset from the sketch before",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 331.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "entering the next value. Beyond the gate the shelf widened. Here both rules",
