          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 343.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "could lie flat, and the difference between their readings matched the offset on",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 355.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "the slip. On the return journey the team left the gauge in place and changed",
