          "y" : 367.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "only the direction from which the marks were read. The two entries agreed at",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 379.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 11.7,
          "text" : "the straight stations. At the bend they differed by half a division, the width",
